<view class="radar-page {{tab === 'knowledge' ? 'deck-page' : ''}}">
  <view class="masthead"><view><text class="brand">技术雷达</text><text class="version">离线演示 v0.6</text></view><button wx:if="{{tab === 'knowledge'}}" class="submit" bindtap="submit">提交信息</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{tab !== 'knowledge'}}" class="heading"><view><view class="title">我的技术卡</view><view class="subtitle">看懂一个工具，再决定用不用。</view></view><button class="submit" bindtap="submit">提交信息</button></view>
  <view class="tabs"><button class="{{tab === 'knowledge' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="knowledge" bindtap="selectTab">知识卡</button><button class="{{tab === 'inbox' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="inbox" bindtap="selectTab">最近收件</button><button class="{{tab === 'ratings' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="ratings" bindtap="selectTab">怎么看</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{tab === 'knowledge'}}" class="deck-content">
    <input class="search" placeholder="找名称，或搜你想做的事" aria-label="搜索知识卡" value="{{query}}" bindinput="search" />
    <scroll-view scroll-x class="filters"><button wx:for="{{kinds}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{selectedKind === item ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-kind="{{item}}" bindtap="selectKind">{{item}}</button></scroll-view>
    <view class="list-tools"><text>{{filtered.length}} 条 · {{evaluatedCount}} 条已有初评</text><view class="tool-actions"><button bindtap="toggleFilters" aria-expanded="{{showFilters}}">筛选</button><button bindtap="refreshCatalog" loading="{{catalogLoading}}">刷新</button></view></view>
<view wx:if="{{catalogError}}" class="error">{{catalogError}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{!filtered.length}}" class="empty">这里还没有符合条件的卡片。<view>试试切回“全部”，或换一个用途关键词。</view></view>
    <swiper wx:if="{{filtered.length}}" class="deck-swiper" current="{{deckIndex}}" bindchange="onDeckChange" autoplay="{{false}}" circular="{{false}}" indicator-dots="{{false}}" vertical="{{false}}" duration="{{220}}" next-margin="14rpx" skip-hidden-item-layout="{{true}}">
      <swiper-item wx:for="{{filtered}}" wx:key="id"><scroll-view scroll-y class="single-card-scroll" enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}">
    <view class="card {{item.cardTone}}"><view class="card-inner">
      <view class="type-line"><text class="type">{{item.cardType}}</text><text class="domain">{{item.cardDomain}}</text></view>
      <view class="identity"><view class="card-name">{{item.cardTitle}}</view><text wx:if="{{item.cardMark}}" class="card-mark">{{item.cardMark}}</text></view>
      <view class="intro">{{item.cardIntro}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.cardUse}}" class="use">{{item.cardUse}}</view>
      <view class="stats"><view wx:for="{{item.dimensions}}" wx:for-item="dimension" wx:key="key" class="stat"><text class="stat-name">{{dimension.title}}</text><view class="stat-value"><view wx:if="{{dimension.score !== null}}" aria-label="{{dimension.title + dimension.score + '分，满分5分，演示分数'}}"><text class="stars">{{dimension.stars}}</text><text class="score">{{dimension.score}}</text><view class="score-note">{{dimension.note}}</view></view><text wx:else class="state">{{dimension.text}}</text></view></view></view>
      <view class="warning"><text>注意：</text>{{item.cardWarning}}</view><view class="decision"><text>现在建议</text><text class="decision-value">{{item.cardAction}}</text></view>
      <view class="card-bottom"><text>{{item.cardDate}}</text><button data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="expand" aria-expanded="{{expandedId === item.id}}">{{expandedId === item.id ? '收起详情' : '查看详情'}}</button></view>
    </view></view>
      </scroll-view></swiper-item>
    </swiper>
    <view wx:if="{{filtered.length}}" class="deck-footer"><button bindtap="previousCard" disabled="{{!canPrevious}}">上一张</button><view class="page-position"><text>{{deckIndex + 1}} / {{filtered.length}}</text><text class="swipe-tip">左右滑动翻卡</text></view><button bindtap="toggleCatalog">目录</button><button bindtap="nextCard" disabled="{{!canNext}}">下一张</button></view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{tab === 'inbox'}}"><view class="notice">实时查询现有收件通道<view>原通道最近20条中的雷达消息，不是全部历史。入库不代表已研究或已评价。</view></view><button class="refresh" bindtap="refreshInbox" loading="{{inboxLoading}}">刷新收件状态</button><view class="muted">{{inboxCheckedAt ? '上次成功查询：' + inboxCheckedAt : '还没有成功查询记录'}}</view><view wx:if="{{inboxError}}" class="error">{{inboxError}}</view><view wx:if="{{!inbox.length && !inboxLoading && !inboxError}}" class="empty">最近记录中没有交给技术雷达的消息。点“提交信息”后发送。</view><view wx:for="{{inbox}}" wx:key="id" class="entry"><view class="entry-meta">{{item.time}}</view><view class="summary inbox-text">{{item.text}}</view><view class="receipt">{{item.status}}</view></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{tab === 'ratings'}}" class="help"><view class="section-title">卡面只说最重要的</view><view>先看它是什么、能帮你做什么、现在值不值得试。想知道理由，再点“查看详情”。</view><view class="section-title">四个判断，各看各的</view><view class="guide"><text>能力</text>在指定任务里做得好不好。</view><view class="guide"><text>可靠</text>能不能稳定完成，有没有反复验证。</view><view class="guide"><text>适用</text>对你当前工作有多大帮助。</view><view class="guide"><text>搭配</text>比你已有的办法增加了什么。</view><view class="section-title">星数怎么理解</view><view>一星明显不足，二星限制较多，三星基本可用，四星表现较好，五星在明确场景中表现突出。</view><view>没查清就写未知；没按需要试过就写待验证。它们都不是一星。</view><view class="section-title">颜色区分类型</view><view>工具、技能、工作流和方法用不同颜色识别，不代表高低等级。旧关注星级放在评价历史中，不代替四方面的判断。</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{catalogOpen}}" class="sheet-mask" bindtap="closeCatalog"><view class="sheet" catchtap="noop"><view class="sheet-heading"><view>卡片目录 · {{filtered.length}} 张</view><button bindtap="closeCatalog">关闭</button></view><view class="sheet-hint">选一张直接打开；可先关闭目录，用分类或搜索缩小范围。</view><scroll-view scroll-y class="sheet-scroll"><view class="catalog-grid"><button wx:for="{{filtered}}" wx:key="id" class="catalog-tile {{currentCardId === item.id ? 'current-tile' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openCatalogCard"><view class="tile-type">{{item.cardType}}</view><view class="tile-title">{{item.cardTitle}}</view><view class="tile-state">{{item.fitScore !== null ? '适用 ' + item.fitScore + ' / 5分' : '待评价'}}</view></button></view></scroll-view></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{showFilters}}" class="sheet-mask" bindtap="closeFilters"><view class="sheet filter-sheet" catchtap="noop"><view class="sheet-heading"><view>筛选卡片</view><button bindtap="closeFilters">完成</button></view><scroll-view scroll-y class="sheet-scroll">
    <view class="filter-panel"><view class="small-label">评价进度</view><view class="evaluation-filters"><button class="chip {{evaluationFilter === 'all' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-value="all" bindtap="selectEvaluation">全部</button><button class="chip {{evaluationFilter === 'assessed' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-value="assessed" bindtap="selectEvaluation">已有初评</button><button class="chip {{evaluationFilter === 'pending' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-value="pending" bindtap="selectEvaluation">待评价</button></view><view class="small-label">对你的适用性（新评价）</view><scroll-view scroll-x class="filters"><button wx:for="{{fitOptions}}" wx:key="value" class="chip {{selectedFit === item.value ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-value="{{item.value}}" bindtap="selectFit">{{item.label}}</button></scroll-view></view>
<view class="sync-note">{{catalogOrigin}} · {{snapshotDate || '尚无同步记录'}}</view></scroll-view></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{detailEntries.length}}" class="sheet-mask" bindtap="closeDetails"><view class="sheet" catchtap="noop"><view class="sheet-heading"><view>卡片详情</view><button bindtap="closeDetails">关闭</button></view><scroll-view scroll-y class="sheet-scroll"><block wx:for="{{detailEntries}}" wx:key="id"><view class="detail-card-title">{{item.cardTitle}}</view><view class="detail-next">下一步：{{item.cardNext}}</view>
      <view class="details">
        <view class="section-title">为什么这样判断</view><view wx:if="{{!item.hasEvaluation}}" class="muted">{{item.relevance}}<view>四方面还没有完成核查，不用旧关注星级补分。</view></view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.hasEvaluation}}" wx:for="{{item.areas}}" wx:for-item="area" wx:key="key" class="area"><view class="area-heading"><text>{{area.title}}</text><text>{{area.label}}</text></view><view>{{area.summary}}</view></view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.hasEvaluation}}" class="reason">{{item.action.reason}}</view>
        <button class="disclosure" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-section="risks" bindtap="toggleSection" aria-expanded="{{openSection === item.id + '|risks'}}">费用与使用风险 {{openSection === item.id + '|risks' ? '－' : '＋'}}</button>
        <view wx:if="{{openSection === item.id + '|risks'}}" class="panel"><view wx:for="{{item.riskRows}}" wx:for-item="risk" wx:key="key" class="risk"><text>{{risk.title}}：</text>{{risk.text}}</view></view>
        <button class="disclosure" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-section="evidence" bindtap="toggleSection" aria-expanded="{{openSection === item.id + '|evidence'}}">来源与核查记录 {{openSection === item.id + '|evidence' ? '－' : '＋'}}</button>
        <view wx:if="{{openSection === item.id + '|evidence'}}" class="panel"><view class="muted">{{item.confidenceReason}}<view>对象版本：{{item.objectVersion}}</view><view>评价场景：{{item.scope}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!item.evidenceRows.length}}">{{item.evidence}}<view>历史介绍不等于当前已实测。</view></view><view wx:for="{{item.evidenceRows}}" wx:for-item="ev" wx:key="id" class="evidence"><view class="evidence-title">{{ev.typeLabel}} · {{ev.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{ev.date}} · {{ev.id}}</view><view>{{ev.summary}}</view><button wx:if="{{ev.url}}" class="link" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-evidence="{{ev.id}}" bindtap="copyEvidence">复制这条来源链接</button></view><view wx:for="{{item.areas}}" wx:for-item="area" wx:key="key"><view wx:if="{{area.references}}" class="muted">{{area.title}}的依据：{{area.references}}</view><view wx:for="{{area.checks}}" wx:for-item="check" wx:key="label" class="check"><view>{{check.label}} · {{check.labelText}}</view><view>{{check.summary}}</view></view></view><view class="label">还没弄清楚</view><view wx:for="{{item.questions}}" wx:for-item="question" wx:key="*this">{{index + 1}}. {{question}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.sourceNote}}</view><button wx:if="{{item.source}}" class="link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="copySource">复制原始来源</button></view>
        <button class="disclosure" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-section="history" bindtap="toggleSection" aria-expanded="{{openSection === item.id + '|history'}}">评价历史 {{openSection === item.id + '|history' ? '－' : '＋'}}</button>
        <view wx:if="{{openSection === item.id + '|history'}}" class="panel"><view class="muted">{{item.attentionLabel}}。旧关注建议保留作参考，不是技术实力。</view><view wx:if="{{!item.historyCount}}">还没有四方面评价记录。</view><view wx:for="{{item.historyRows}}" wx:for-item="record" wx:key="id" class="history"><view>{{record.date}} · {{record.reason}}</view><view>{{record.conclusion}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{item.ruleVersion}}" class="muted">规则版本：{{item.ruleVersion}}</view></view>
      </view></block></scroll-view></view></view>
</view>
